From: ChatGPT <noreply@openai.com>
Subject: [PATCH] mtk: mt_wifi: widen bDynamicVlanDisabled guard

bDynamicVlanDisabled is referenced in ap_data.c under
RT_CFG80211_SUPPORT || DYNAMIC_VLAN_SUPPORT, but only declared
under DYNAMIC_VLAN_SUPPORT. Widen the guard.

---
 mt_wifi/embedded/include/rtmp.h | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/mt_wifi/embedded/include/rtmp.h b/mt_wifi/embedded/include/rtmp.h
--- a/mt_wifi/embedded/include/rtmp.h
+++ b/mt_wifi/embedded/include/rtmp.h
@@ -3637,3 +3637,3 @@
-#ifdef DYNAMIC_VLAN_SUPPORT
+#if defined(RT_CFG80211_SUPPORT) || defined(DYNAMIC_VLAN_SUPPORT)
    BOOLEAN bDynamicVlanDisabled;
 #endif
